---
layout: base.njk
title: Welcome to White Papper
description: Discover children’s books, Indian mythology, and simple ways to build a joyful reading life.
---
<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A quiet place for curious readers</p><h1>Welcome to White Papper</h1><p class="lead">A calm corner for young readers and children to build identity, values, and critical thinking .</p><a class="button" href="/my-books/">Meet my books</a><a class="button alt" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Written with heart</p><h2>My books</h2></div><a href="/my-books/">See all books →</a></div><div class="grid">{% for book in collections.books | limit(3) %}<article class="card book-card"><img class="cover" src="{{ book.data.cover }}" alt="Cover of {{ book.data.title }}"><div><h3>{{ book.data.title }}</h3><p class="meta">Ages {{ book.data.age }}</p><p>{{ book.data.summary }}</p><a class="button" href="{{ book.data.amazon }}" rel="nofollow sponsored">Buy on Amazon</a></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Fresh from the reading table</p><h2>Latest stories &amp; guides</h2></div><a href="/blog/">All articles →</a></div><div class="grid">{% for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}<article class="card"><img class="article-image" src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt }}"><p class="meta">{{ post.date | date }} · {{ post.data.category }}</p><h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Find the right next read</p><h2>Books worth sharing</h2></div><a href="/book-recommendations/">Browse recommendations →</a></div><div class="grid">{% for item in collections.recommendations | limit(3) %}<article class="card book-card"><img class="cover" src="{{ item.data.cover }}" alt="Cover of {{ item.data.title }}"><div><p class="meta">{{ item.data.audience }}</p><h3>{{ item.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.data.why }}</p></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="newsletter"><p class="eyebrow">A note, once in a while</p><h2>Join the reading circle</h2><p>Receive bookish ideas, new posts, and gentle reading inspiration. Replace this form’s action with your Mailchimp, Buttondown, or Beehiiv form link.</p><form action="#" method="post"><label class="skip" for="home-email">Email address</label><input id="home-email" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required><button class="button" type="submit">Subscribe</button></form></div></section>
